            "review_text": "edt0\nSingapore, Singapore92 contributions\n0\nNice restaurant within Takashimaya HCMC\nOct 2016 • Business\nThis place has all the service you expect from a Japanese restaurant. Except that you are not in Tokyo or any part of Japan. You are in HCMC.\n\nTheir attention to you is almost overwhelming. The service staff who attended to us all speak relatively ok Japanese. Good enough to answer simple questions from us and take our orders.\n\nFood is nice. We ordered the Mizutaki Kihon set for 2.\n\nThey served us each bowl of servings until we finished the entire hot pot. And they did that with patience and care.\n\nWith beer, total bill came up to 1,243,000VND or about USD60 for 2pax. Good experience.\nRead more\nWritten October 20, 2016",
